The role prompts in this directory (comprehension, critic, critic-b, codebase, zoom-out,
merge, resolve and the shared rules in common.ts) are adapted from the Elephant-Goldfish
Model:

  Elephant-Goldfish Model
  https://github.com/google/elephant-goldfish-model (commit 464db031e)
  Copyright 2026 Google LLC
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

Source files adapted: agents/comprehension.md, agents/design_critic.md, agents/zoom_out.md,
agents/codebase_details.md, agents/implementation_readiness.md, agents/synthesizer.md and
skills/egm-resolve/SKILL.md.

Modified by Rovara (PrepLabsAI). The changes: the interactive review gates are removed
(the review is asynchronous and unclear points become questions with options and a
recommendation); the brainstorm mode and the structural and style roles are dropped;
findings are one strict JSON block, each with at least one citation; the roles are
combined (design critic with zoom out, codebase details with implementation readiness)
and fitted to a fixed design template; the resolve rules (propose fix, contest, escalate,
decline) become fixed, contested, asked and declined; and all material under review is
treated as untrusted data.

